, you're still putting on an act, aren't you?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","exclamation","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","Your true target is her weapon. Correct?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,-70.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,0.9,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["hide","avg1_143",0.6],["ctl","avg3_195","a","023","symbol",0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.6],["say","avg3_195","What are you talking about?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","I don't know about your God or War or the Archons' ritual and all that.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But on second thought, no commander would possibly order their warriors to kill each other before battle.",1,""],["ctl","avg3_195","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Plus, every person Wraith and I encountered who had been controlled would collapse after their weapons were knocked out of their hands.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","exclamation","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","The real rule of this ritual ... is to disarm your opponent, isn't it?",1,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Wraith clung tightly to her blade even when she fell to the ground—==W==she never gave up the fight.",1,""],["w",0.6],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["tsk","Xiao"],["mrt",0,"z","026",null,"jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_195","a","005","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_195","Hmph, Tyrant, as a \"Witness,\" you can kiss your safety guarantee goodbye the moment you intervene.",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_195","a",null,"question",null,-0.25,1.3,null,"diantou","OutQuad",0.37],["w",0.37],["say"